{"seq":1,"slug":"coroutine-fundamentals","title":"协程基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/coroutine-fundamentals","wordCount":827,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"协程基础\">协程基础</h1><p>Kotlin 协程是一种轻量级的并发解决方案，允许以顺序化的代码风格编写异步逻辑。协程不绑定到特定线程，可以在一个线程上挂起并在另一个线程上恢复，极大简化了异步编程的复杂度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>协程的核心是<strong>可挂起的计算</strong>：它不绑定线程，能在挂起处让出执行权、稍后在同一或其他线程恢复，从而用顺序化的代码表达异步逻辑。与线程的抢占式调度不同，协程是协作式的——主动让出而非被强制抢占。结构化并发进一步规定：协程在其 <code>CoroutineScope</code> 内成树状组织，父作用域负责子协程的生命周期与取消。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"什么是协程\">什么是协程</h2><p>协程本质上是一种可挂起的计算。与线程不同，协程是协作式的——它们主动让出执行权，而非被操作系统强制调度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 线程模型&#10;        A[Thread 1] --&gt;|阻塞等待| B[IO 完成]&#10;        B --&gt; C[继续执行]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 协程模型&#10;        D[Coroutine 1] --&gt;|挂起| E[释放线程]&#10;        E --&gt;|IO 完成后恢复| F[继续执行]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 线程模型\n        A[Thread 1] --&gt;|阻塞等待| B[IO 完成]\n        B --&gt; C[继续执行]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 协程模型\n        D[Coroutine 1] --&gt;|挂起| E[释放线程]\n        E --&gt;|IO 完成后恢复| F[继续执行]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 一个线程可以运行数千个协程，而创建同等数量的线程会导致内存耗尽。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"suspend-函数\">suspend 函数</h2><p><code>suspend</code> 关键字标记可以被挂起的函数。挂起函数只能在协程或其他挂起函数中调用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"suspend fun fetchUser(id: Long): User {&#10;    delay(1000) // 挂起 1 秒，不阻塞线程&#10;    return User(id, &quot;张三&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;suspend fun fetchUserPosts(userId: Long): List&lt;Post&gt; {&#10;    delay(500)&#10;    return listOf(Post(&quot;Kotlin 协程入门&quot;), Post(&quot;Flow 实战&quot;))&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun fetchUser(id: Long): User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    delay(1000) // 挂起 1 秒，不阻塞线程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return User(id, \"张三\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun fetchUserPosts(userId: Long): List&#x3C;Post> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    delay(500)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return listOf(Post(\"Kotlin 协程入门\"), Post(\"Flow 实战\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>挂起函数在编译后会被转换为带有 <code>Continuation</code> 参数的普通函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 编译后的签名大致为：&#10;// fun fetchUser(id: Long, continuation: Continuation&lt;User&gt;): Any?\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 编译后的签名大致为：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// fun fetchUser(id: Long, continuation: Continuation&#x3C;User>): Any?</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"coroutinescope\">CoroutineScope</h2><p><code>CoroutineScope</code> 定义了协程的生命周期边界。所有协程都必须在某个作用域内启动：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class UserRepository {&#10;    private val scope = CoroutineScope(SupervisorJob() + Dispatchers.IO)&#10;&#10;    fun loadUser(id: Long) {&#10;        scope.launch {&#10;            val user = fetchUser(id)&#10;            println(&quot;加载用户: ${user.name}&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun cleanup() {&#10;        scope.cancel()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class UserRepository {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val scope = CoroutineScope(SupervisorJob() + Dispatchers.IO)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun loadUser(id: Long) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        scope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val user = fetchUser(id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println(\"加载用户: ${user.name}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun cleanup() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        scope.cancel()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Android 中常用的作用域：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>作用域</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>viewModelScope</code></td>\n<td>ViewModel 存活期间</td>\n<td>UI 相关的异步操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>lifecycleScope</code></td>\n<td>Activity/Fragment 生命周期</td>\n<td>界面相关操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GlobalScope</code></td>\n<td>应用全局</td>\n<td>不推荐，缺乏结构化控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义 <code>CoroutineScope</code></td>\n<td>手动管理</td>\n<td>仓库层、服务层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"job-与生命周期\">Job 与生命周期</h2><p>每个协程都关联一个 <code>Job</code> 对象，用于管理协程的生命周期：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val job = scope.launch {&#10;    repeat(100) { i -&gt;&#10;        println(&quot;工作中 $i ...&quot;)&#10;        delay(500)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;delay(2000)&#10;job.cancel()       // 取消协程&#10;job.join()         // 等待协程完成取消&#10;// 或&#10;job.cancelAndJoin() // 合并操作\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val job = scope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repeat(100) { i -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"工作中 $i ...\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(500)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>delay(2000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>job.cancel()       // 取消协程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>job.join()         // 等待协程完成取消</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 或</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>job.cancelAndJoin() // 合并操作</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; New&#10;    New --&gt; Active : start&#10;    Active --&gt; Completing : 完成工作&#10;    Active --&gt; Cancelling : cancel&#10;    Completing --&gt; Completed : 子协程完成&#10;    Cancelling --&gt; Cancelled : 子协程取消&#10;    Completed --&gt; [*]&#10;    Cancelled --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; New\n    New --&gt; Active : start\n    Active --&gt; Completing : 完成工作\n    Active --&gt; Cancelling : cancel\n    Completing --&gt; Completed : 子协程完成\n    Cancelling --&gt; Cancelled : 子协程取消\n    Completed --&gt; [*]\n    Cancelled --&gt; [*]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"launch-vs-async\">launch vs async</h2><p>Kotlin 提供两种主要的协程构建器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    // launch: 启动即忘（fire-and-forget），返回 Job&#10;    val job = launch {&#10;        delay(1000)&#10;        println(&quot;launch 完成&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // async: 启动并返回结果，返回 Deferred&lt;T&gt;&#10;    val deferred = async {&#10;        delay(1000)&#10;        &quot;async 的结果&quot;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    val result = deferred.await() // 等待结果&#10;    println(result)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // launch: 启动即忘（fire-and-forget），返回 Job</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val job = launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"launch 完成\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // async: 启动并返回结果，返回 Deferred&#x3C;T></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val deferred = async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"async 的结果\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val result = deferred.await() // 等待结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>构建器</th>\n<th>返回类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>异常行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>launch</code></td>\n<td><code>Job</code></td>\n<td>不需要返回值的异步任务</td>\n<td>抛出异常给父协程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>async</code></td>\n<td><code>Deferred&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>需要异步计算结果</td>\n<td>异常在 <code>await()</code> 时抛出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"并行分解\">并行分解</h2><p><code>async</code> 特别适合将任务分解为并行子任务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"suspend fun loadDashboard(): Dashboard = coroutineScope {&#10;    val userDeferred = async { fetchUser(userId) }&#10;    val postsDeferred = async { fetchUserPosts(userId) }&#10;    val statsDeferred = async { fetchStats(userId) }&#10;&#10;    // 三个请求并行执行，总耗时取决于最慢的请求&#10;    Dashboard(&#10;        user = userDeferred.await(),&#10;        posts = postsDeferred.await(),&#10;        stats = statsDeferred.await()&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun loadDashboard(): Dashboard = coroutineScope {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val userDeferred = async { fetchUser(userId) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val postsDeferred = async { fetchUserPosts(userId) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val statsDeferred = async { fetchStats(userId) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 三个请求并行执行，总耗时取决于最慢的请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Dashboard(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        user = userDeferred.await(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        posts = postsDeferred.await(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        stats = statsDeferred.await()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"gantt\" data-source=\"gantt&#10;    title 并行 vs 串行执行&#10;    dateFormat X&#10;    axisFormat %s&#10;&#10;    section 串行&#10;    fetchUser       :0, 1000&#10;    fetchPosts      :1000, 1500&#10;    fetchStats      :1500, 2500&#10;&#10;    section 并行&#10;    fetchUser       :0, 1000&#10;    fetchPosts      :0, 500&#10;    fetchStats      :0, 1000\">gantt\n    title 并行 vs 串行执行\n    dateFormat X\n    axisFormat %s\n\n    section 串行\n    fetchUser       :0, 1000\n    fetchPosts      :1000, 1500\n    fetchStats      :1500, 2500\n\n    section 并行\n    fetchUser       :0, 1000\n    fetchPosts      :0, 500\n    fetchStats      :0, 1000</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"结构化并发\">结构化并发</h2><p>Kotlin 协程遵循结构化并发原则——父协程会等待所有子协程完成，子协程的失败会传播给父协程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"suspend fun processOrders(orders: List&lt;Order&gt;) = coroutineScope {&#10;    orders.forEach { order -&gt;&#10;        launch {&#10;            processOrder(order)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    // coroutineScope 会等待所有 launch 的子协程完成&#10;    // 如果任何一个子协程失败，所有兄弟协程都会被取消&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun processOrders(orders: List&#x3C;Order>) = coroutineScope {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    orders.forEach { order -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            processOrder(order)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // coroutineScope 会等待所有 launch 的子协程完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 如果任何一个子协程失败，所有兄弟协程都会被取消</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>coroutineScope</code> 创建的作用域会等待所有子协程，而 <code>supervisorScope</code> 允许子协程独立失败。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"runblocking\">runBlocking</h2><p><code>runBlocking</code> 桥接阻塞世界与协程世界，它会阻塞当前线程直到内部协程完成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    launch {&#10;        delay(1000)&#10;        println(&quot;World!&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;    println(&quot;Hello&quot;)&#10;}&#10;// 输出：Hello&#10;// （1 秒后）World!\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"World!\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(\"Hello\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 输出：Hello</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// （1 秒后）World!</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>runBlocking</code> 主要用于 <code>main</code> 函数和测试代码。在生产代码中应避免使用，以免阻塞线程。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>协程</strong>是轻量级的并发原语，可以挂起和恢复而不阻塞线程</li>\n<li><strong>suspend 函数</strong>通过 <code>suspend</code> 关键字声明，是协程中执行异步操作的基本单元</li>\n<li><strong>CoroutineScope</strong> 定义协程的生命周期边界，确保资源正确释放</li>\n<li><strong>Job</strong> 管理协程的生命周期状态，支持取消和等待操作</li>\n<li><strong>launch</strong> 用于不需要返回值的异步任务，<strong>async</strong> 用于需要返回结果的并行计算</li>\n<li><strong>结构化并发</strong>确保父子协程之间的生命周期关系清晰、异常传播可控</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"协程基础","id":"协程基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是协程","id":"什么是协程"},{"level":2,"text":"suspend 函数","id":"suspend-函数"},{"level":2,"text":"CoroutineScope","id":"coroutinescope"},{"level":2,"text":"Job 与生命周期","id":"job-与生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"launch vs async","id":"launch-vs-async"},{"level":2,"text":"并行分解","id":"并行分解"},{"level":2,"text":"结构化并发","id":"结构化并发"},{"level":2,"text":"runBlocking","id":"runblocking"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"密封层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/type-system/sealed-hierarchies"},"next":{"title":"协程上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/coroutine-context"}}